WEBVTT

00:12:58.793 --> 00:13:00.302
That'd be the second thing.

00:13:00.302 --> 00:13:02.838
And then the third thing would be,

00:13:02.838 --> 00:13:06.029
please show me a sheaf of texts

00:13:06.029 --> 00:13:07.986
written by 16-year-old girls,

00:13:07.986 --> 00:13:10.440
because I would want to know where this language

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.395
had developed since our times,

00:13:12.395 --> 00:13:16.028
and ideally I would then send them back to you and me now

00:13:16.028 --> 00:13:18.548
so we could examine this linguistic miracle

00:13:18.548 --> 00:13:20.898
happening right under our noses.

00:13:20.898 --> 00:13:22.414
Thank you very much.

00:13:22.414 --> 00:13:27.582
(Applause)

00:13:27.582 --> 00:13:31.189
Thank you. (Applause)